gives me 6 !oGL) and, after >50,000 turns of blood and sweat, is
standing on the vibrating square.  He carefully took out the candles
from his BoH and fit them to the Candelabrum, rang the bell and read
the Book.....

"You raised the dead!"

After painlessly killing all new guests, Dus checked once again for
what might went wrong, and decided that the Book may have been
cursed.  So he carefully took out a !oHW, dip the Book in it and
started the ritual all over again....

"You raised the dead!"

