Bell had only two charges and now they are both gone! And Dus did not
have any means to recharge the Bell! All ?oC were used up and the only
magic marker is 1:2....So what went wrong?

After checking the Invocation Artifacts once again....Guess
what?...Dus forgot to light up the Candelabrum! (I though it is
already lit after Dus applied 7 candles to it....)

Now Dus continues his aimless trip back to the main dungeon, in hope
